}F\\cdot {n}_{3}\\,\\text{d}s=0.\n$$\n\nTherefore, we conclude that\n\n$$\n{∮}_{C}F\\cdot n\\,\\text{d}s=0.\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Flux Across a Square Using Symmetry"}]}
